1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,963
What extra information lets a reflection
find an object outside the screen?

2
00:00:06,963 --> 00:00:11,793
We compare scene representations and
ray acceleration, follow spatial and

3
00:00:11,793 --> 00:00:17,153
