101
00:08:36,633 --> 00:08:41,183
Halving both image dimensions
gives one quarter as many pixels.

102
00:08:41,183 --> 00:08:46,165
That does not imply one quarter of
total game cost, since simulation,

103
00:08:46,165 --> 00:08:50,353
geometry, memory and reconstruction
may scale differently.

104
00:08:50,713 --> 00:08:54,581
Motion vectors help locate
previous correspondence. Their

105
00:08:54,581 --> 00:08:58,583
direction, units and jitter
convention must agree. A single

106
00:08:58,583 --> 00:09:02,993
global image shift cannot represent
independently moving objects.

107
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:07,049
Newly revealed surfaces may lack
history and require greater reliance

108
00:09:07,049 --> 00:09:10,842
on current information. Depth or
surface changes help reject invalid

109
00:09:10,842 --> 00:09:14,300
correspondence; more accumulation
is not automatically better.

110
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:19,511
Thin moving lines, small lettering
and disocclusion boundaries are useful

111
00:09:19,511 --> 00:09:24,670
tests. Still sharpness and temporal
stability remain separate observations.

112
00:09:24,983 --> 00:09:29,503
In the Wolfenstein comparison, examine
